Date: Fri, 11 Sep 2026 08:12:35 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 00/13] cpm: update deployment customizations

Apply the numbered patches in series order to the pinned public
upstream commit. This series preserves the shared ICPM/PCPM behavior.
Review each patch and run the deployment and application checks before
publishing. No review, testing or DCO trailers are synthesized.

zeroday0619 (13):
  oauth: synchronize trusted role claims on account updates
  access: retain the last account in an assigned access list
  auth: validate proxy authentication inputs and transports
  l4: restrict web-owned overrides to numeric port bindings
  analytics: retain tailnet-aware request attribution
  branding: add TOMORI presentation primitives and local fonts
  status: integrate branded responses and error feedback
  ui: apply the shared interface to management screens
  build: share pinned images and isolate customization checks
  anubis: add scoped controls and transactional runtime settings
  ui: expose Anubis policy and challenge controls
  anubis: supervise runtime changes without Docker access
  ui: align Anubis controls with shared settings forms

